# New Forever dungeon. Sources: level range (Blizzard's, via foreverchanges.pro/dungeons), quest givers and
# hand-ins = foreverchanges.pro/dungeon-quests and its quest pages; entrance = Questie dungeons.lua
# (Undercity map 72.4, 11.4: the ruins above the city). These quests are not in the Questie quest data.
@dungeon Ruins of Lordaeron
@levels 15-20
@window 15-22
@best 19
@hub Undercity, 66.0, 44.0
@entrance Undercity, 72.4, 11.4
A 92421 @ Undercity, 57.8, 89.8 | Morbin Lightbane in the Royal Quarter. Collect 25 Intact Limbs in the Ruins of Lordaeron.
A 95216 @ Undercity, 46.6, 71.4 | Theodore Griffs in the Apothecarium. The Highly Toxic Strain drops from Witherfang.
A 92422 @ Tirisfal Glades, 65.2, 60.2 | Deathguard Kristof in Brill. Only offered if you did Deathguard Linnea's Rear Guard Patrol quests; if he has nothing, press Skip.
A 92401 @ Silverpine Forest, 44.4, 43.0 | Tabitha Heartweaver at the Sepulcher. Look for her husband Edward in the dungeon.
RUN | The entrance is in the ruined city above the Undercity. Inside: The Baron drops an Abominable Head that starts Unending Torment, and a Crest of Lordaeron lies in a tower near Bjork or on the wall of the small temple at the far end (it moves) and starts a quest too.
